 IMP20261109-A7C7 | business.erp.unit | PARTIAL |          8 |          3 |          5 |             2 |        6
 IMP20261109-CC13 | business.erp.unit | FAILED  |          8 |          3 |          5 |             0 |        5
 IMP20261109-DFAC | system.dict_item  | FAILED  |          0 |          0 |          0 |             0 |        0
 IMP20261109-8D03 | system.dict_item  | SUCCESS |       2000 |       2000 |          0 |          2000 |        0
